{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends of a Feather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An absurd adventure RPG full of secrets, turn-based battles, and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kino</strong>, a timid boy searching for his missing parents \u2014 joined by <strong>Gosty</strong>, an annoying ghost; <strong>Doki</strong>, the \u201clegendary\u201d bird hero; and <strong>Charlotte</strong>, who still believes in the good of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple investigation soon turns into a strange, funny, and \u2014 for some reason \u2014 dinosaur-filled journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters \u2014 nobody\u2019s got time for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No EXP \u2014 here, strategy is what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is unique, with wild ideas and unexpected dialogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join <strong>Kino, Gosty, Doki, and Charlotte</strong> in an adventure that involves:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trespassing on private property</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drinking skunk milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting a dance club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging God</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making enemies who become friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends who become enemies (but actually were friends all along)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting a tiger club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally ruining a date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purposely ruining a wedding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short adventure (around 3 to 6 hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor, emotion, and secrets around every corner.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999630?t=1768858007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999630?t=1768858007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999630/67953cae7fb5a678d556c66a55fd2aa462cbd867/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768858007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999630/67953cae7fb5a678d556c66a55fd2aa462cbd867/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768858007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4269710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends of a Feather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An absurd adventure RPG full of secrets, turn-based battles, and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Kino</strong>, a timid boy searching for his missing parents \u2014 joined by <strong>Gosty</strong>, an annoying ghost; <strong>Doki</strong>, the \u201clegendary\u201d bird hero; and <strong>Charlotte</strong>, who still believes in the good of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple investigation soon turns into a strange, funny, and \u2014 for some reason \u2014 dinosaur-filled journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters \u2014 nobody\u2019s got time for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No EXP \u2014 here, strategy is what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is unique, with wild ideas and unexpected dialogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join <strong>Kino, Gosty, Doki, and Charlotte</strong> in an adventure that involves:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trespassing on private property</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drinking skunk milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting a dance club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging God</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making enemies who become friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making friends who become enemies (but actually were friends all along)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting a tiger club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally ruining a date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purposely ruining a wedding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short adventure (around 3 to 6 hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor, emotion, and secrets around every corner.</p>","developers":["Stricle"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999630/bec2afd96bea9b3fbf2f5cf77fd36decad09f41b/header.jpg?t=1768858007","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Stricle LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3999630/1928914940/17b4bcf42a2eef1ab347143bcb416eb0360f69b3/1758984434/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760527208","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamst